            <title>[KYLIN-5343] Model import should check the low-level data source type + Model import should check the table columns in data source type</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5343</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Create model &lt;b&gt;model1&lt;/b&gt;: lineorder inner join customer, export the model&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Delete the &lt;b&gt;lineorder&lt;/b&gt; table from the data source, resulting in a broken model&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Import the model again, but it cannot overwrite the original model (the same model without any changes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Desired outcome: Covering the original model&lt;/p&gt;

